              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Longbow, light armour and hand weapon. May carry a buckler (+1 pt). May have a maul (+1 pt, a clumsy double-handed mallet that swings last at +1 Strength). May have Stakes (+20 pts per unit). Stakes. May be Open Order (free). (Armies of Chivalry p.34)</characteristic>
