              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Throwing spear, javelins, hand weapon and buckler. Open Order. Feigned Flight. One unit per 1,000 army points may give up throwing spears and become skirmishers (not enforced). (Armies of Chivalry p.34)</characteristic>
