              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Improvised weapon (a dagger for slashing downed knights' throats). May have light armour (+1 pt). May have hand weapon and buckler (+1 pt) or thrusting spear (+1 pt) or halberd (+2 pts). Fear formed cavalry units. (Armies of Chivalry p.34)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
            <profile id="07b6-5f57-25f3-63da" name="Armour Save" hidden="false" typeId="0dbe-f4ed-ef08-8e86" typeName="Armour Save">
